WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.340 --> 00:00:02.450
We are Team Astralis!

2
00:00:02.620 --> 00:00:05.450
How do you land at the lunar SOUTH POLE

3
00:00:05.578 --> 00:00:08.410
with power AND Earth contact?

4
00:00:08.797 --> 00:00:11.207
We built a NOVEL patch finder,

5
00:00:11.267 --> 00:00:13.800
beyond NASA's preset landing sites.

6
00:00:13.860 --> 00:00:16.120
Choose your date and mission length.

7
00:00:16.217 --> 00:00:18.870
We combine solar-elevation-based energy,

8
00:00:18.979 --> 00:00:20.870
continuous Earth view,

9
00:00:21.010 --> 00:00:23.350
and slopes below ten degrees

10
00:00:23.430 --> 00:00:25.050
over a hundred metres.

11
00:00:25.260 --> 00:00:28.250
Now fly from orbit to the surface...

12
00:00:28.460 --> 00:00:29.370
and WALK!
